    <item>
      <title>v1.5.2 - September 1, 2026</title>
      <link>https://colourpalettes.techhive.net/changelog#v1.5.2</link>
      <pubDate>Tue, 01 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <guid>https://colourpalettes.techhive.net/changelog#v1.5.2</guid>
      <description><![CDATA[
        <ul>
          <li><strong>1,250 New Curated Palettes</strong>: Added 50 new palettes to each of 25 categories, bringing the total to over 4,600 palettes for even more creative inspiration.</li>
          <li><strong>Updated Category Counts</strong>: The browse buttons now reflect the expanded library with accurate palette counts per category.</li>
        </ul>
      ]]></description>
    </item>

    <item>
      <title>v1.5.1 - August 24, 2026</title>
      <link>https://colourpalettes.techhive.net/changelog#v1.5.1</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 24 Aug 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <guid>https://colourpalettes.techhive.net/changelog#v1.5.1</guid>
      <description><![CDATA[
        <ul>
          <li><strong>1,250 New Curated Palettes</strong>: Added 50 new palettes to each of 25 categories, bringing the total to over 3,300 palettes for even more creative inspiration.</li>
          <li><strong>Refreshed Interface Icons</strong>: Updated icons across the palette browser and landing page for a cleaner, more consistent visual experience.</li>
          <li><strong>Updated Changelog Feed</strong>: Refreshed the update history page and feed to reflect the latest improvements.</li>
        </ul>
      ]]></description>
    </item>

    <item>
      <title>v1.5.0 - August 8, 2026</title>
      <link>https://colourpalettes.techhive.net/changelog#v1.5.0</link>
      <pubDate>Sat, 08 Aug 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <guid>https://colourpalettes.techhive.net/changelog#v1.5.0</guid>
      <description><![CDATA[
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Massively Expanded Palette Library</strong>: Added 750 new curated palettes across 25 categories, bringing the total to over 1,800 palettes for even more inspiration.</li>
          <li><strong>Category-Tailored Colors</strong>: Each category received 30 new palettes with colors specifically tuned to its theme, from warm reds and pastels to vibrant neons and seasonal collections.</li>
          <li><strong>Consistent Results</strong>: The new palettes are generated deterministically, so you see the same curated selections every time you visit.</li>
          <li><strong>Updated Category Counts</strong>: The browse buttons now reflect the expanded library with accurate palette counts per category.</li>
        </ul>
      ]]></description>
    </item>

    <item>
      <title>v1.4.1 - June 8, 2026</title>
      <link>https://colourpalettes.techhive.net/changelog#v1.4.1</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 08 Jun 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <guid>https://colourpalettes.techhive.net/changelog#v1.4.1</guid>
      <description><![CDATA[
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Clearer Project Summary</strong>: Refreshed the public overview so visitors can quickly understand what the app does and why it is useful.</li>
          <li><strong>Updated History Page</strong>: Added this checkpoint to the update history while keeping every previous release visible.</li>
          <li><strong>Easier Feed Subscription</strong>: Refreshed the subscribe option so people can follow future updates from the changelog.</li>
          <li><strong>Version Visibility</strong>: The footer now makes it easier to open the app history from the displayed version and Changelog link.</li>
          <li><strong>Publishing Refresh</strong>: Search and feed information now reflect the latest checkpoint.</li>
        </ul>
      ]]></description>
    </item>

    <item>
      <title>v1.4.0 - May 9, 2026</title>
      <link>https://colourpalettes.techhive.net/changelog#v1.4.0</link>
      <pubDate>Sat, 09 May 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <guid>https://colourpalettes.techhive.net/changelog#v1.4.0</guid>
      <description><![CDATA[
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Refined User Interface</strong>: Redesigned header layout, modernized the UI theme styling, and improved contrast across the app.</li>
          <li><strong>Enhanced Palette Generator</strong>: Added a new Color Values card to the generator for better insights and fixed the layout for Lightbox and Palette UI.</li>
          <li><strong>Spring Clean Palettes</strong>: Introduced 10 fresh, new Spring Clean palettes.</li>
          <li><strong>Visual Upgrades & Fixes</strong>: Updated background gradients and orbs, resolved issues with the Radix Tabs component structure, and fixed category pill counts.</li>
        </ul>
      ]]></description>
    </item>
    
    <item>
      <title>v1.3.1 - April 5, 2026</title>
      <link>https://colourpalettes.techhive.net/changelog#v1.3.1</link>
      <pubDate>Sun, 05 Apr 2026 12:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <guid>https://colourpalettes.techhive.net/changelog#v1.3.1</guid>
      <description><![CDATA[
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Accessibility & Hero Polish</strong>: Thorough contrast improvements across stats, headers, footer navigation, and more. Colors perfectly match WCAG AA/AAA guidelines to support low-vision users.</li>
          <li><strong>Hero Revamp</strong>: Sleeker glassmorphic hero style, enhanced alignment, optimized fonts, and Open Source contributions highlighted.</li>
          <li><strong>SEO & Publishing Infrastructure</strong>: sitemap.xml, robots.txt, and active RSS feeds configured. Added a dedicated Changelog history page.</li>
          <li><strong>Documentation Overhaul</strong>: Completely revamped the public README with shields.io badges, structured Markdown tables, and quick action banners.</li>
        </ul>
      ]]></description>
    </item>

    <item>
